@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create order (publishes OrderCreated to RabbitMQ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": null,
  "userId": 1,
  "orderNumber": null,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 107,
      "productName": "Demo line item 4",
      "price": 25.50,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Get order by id (set @orderId from create response)
@orderId = 15
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### List orders for a user
@userId = 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order/user/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json
